1894
01:20:38,374 --> 01:20:39,940
Will!

1895
01:20:39,940 --> 01:20:40,873
Deus.

1896
01:20:42,307 --> 01:20:43,773
911, já!

1897
01:20:45,174 --> 01:20:47,507
Vamos, Will.

1898
01:20:47,507 --> 01:20:48,708
Will.

1899
01:20:48,708 --> 01:20:49,641
Vamos lá.

1900
01:21:21,840 --> 01:21:24,140
Mantenha-se contactável Dr. Oldman,

1901
